serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The following table sets forth, as May 10, 2024, the dollar range of our equity securities that are owned by each of our Adviser&#8217;s professionals that do not serve on our board of directors. </span></div><div style="margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:8pt;text-indent:24.75pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:80.263%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:71.031%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.710%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:25.859%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Name of Professional</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-top:2.65pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Dollar Range of Equity  </span></div><div style="margin-bottom:1.5pt;margin-top:2pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Securities in PFLOAT</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline"> (1)(2)</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:1.5pt;margin-top:1.65pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;fo